{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daisen</strong> is a fast, stylish, and unpredictable first-person shooter where your skill and reflexes decide the outcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1768555252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1768555252 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Emilia Svytanko</strong>. An ordinary girl who lived between pills and dreams, between weakness and stubbornness. But when the world cracked because of someone\u2019s incompetence, you were given a choice that felt like fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are a <strong>weapon</strong>. Now you are the <strong>boundary</strong> that separates chaos from life. But what happens when that boundary begins to fade? And can you save those you love without losing yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.poster.avif?t=1768555252\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.webm?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.mp4?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1768555252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1768555252 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No bullets. No reloading. Just pure action.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every shot count \u2014 your weapons don\u2019t use regular ammo, but they <i>can</i> overheat!</strong> This baby runs hot, so keep an eye on the heat levels. Mix up your arsenal, chain attacks, and stay cool under fire!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast. Tactical. Stylish.</strong> Every move brings Death closer to your enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing? Only through killing. You\u2019re used to it by now, aren\u2019t you, Emilia?</strong> <br>The essence of anomalies flows within you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move you make is a step toward achieving your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.poster.avif?t=1768555252\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.webm?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.mp4?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1768555252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/d181a704d8317b6ae8aadae7d417fc7b.avif?t=1768555252 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community and chat with the developers on our <i><strong>Discord</strong></i> server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.poster.avif?t=1768555252\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.webm?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/0303d95b0b00854a9419f668556c43d4.mp4?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702380?t=1768555252","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/e2d850acdbdbdc5c3d1461cec01fdbf74c8f7ce0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768555252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/ab8e2e1865a822385cd682b2a4e52724ad3bd126/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768555252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/ab8e2e1865a822385cd682b2a4e52724ad3bd126/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768555252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains stylized first-person gun and melee combat, with visible blood splashes during combat."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daisen</strong> is a fast, stylish, and unpredictable first-person shooter where your skill and reflexes decide the outcome.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1768555252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/65d6b0e6b08a562d9b111899fe2cb041.avif?t=1768555252 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Emilia Svytanko</strong>. An ordinary girl who lived between pills and dreams, between weakness and stubbornness. But when the world cracked because of someone\u2019s incompetence, you were given a choice that felt like fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are a <strong>weapon</strong>. Now you are the <strong>boundary</strong> that separates chaos from life. But what happens when that boundary begins to fade? And can you save those you love without losing yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.poster.avif?t=1768555252\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.webm?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/562f51385b3bdc35bb4bfbe4dacbfafe.mp4?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1768555252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras_big/faae5306af670af93e8623eea3a6e309.avif?t=1768555252 width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No bullets. No reloading. Just pure action.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every shot count \u2014 your weapons don\u2019t use regular ammo, but they <i>can</i> overheat!</strong> This baby runs hot, so keep an eye on the heat levels. Mix up your arsenal, chain attacks, and stay cool under fire!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast. Tactical. Stylish.</strong> Every move brings Death closer to your enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing? Only through killing. You\u2019re used to it by now, aren\u2019t you, Emilia?</strong> <br>The essence of anomalies flows within you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move you make is a step toward achieving your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.poster.avif?t=1768555252\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.webm?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/extras/5820d9f837f32bb92c1958becf23937c.mp4?t=1768555252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702380/ex